# .lycheeignore — per-vault overrides for lychee link checker
# One pattern per line. Supports regex and glob.
# Reference: https://github.com/lycheeverse/lychee/blob/master/.lycheeignore
#
# Universal config (timeout, file extensions, Cloudflare-walled sites, etc.)
# lives in `lychee.toml`. This file is for vault-specific patterns that
# don't fit cleanly in the TOML config.

# mDNS / LAN hostnames frequently referenced in network-related notes.
.*\.local
.*\.lan

# Add more vault-specific patterns below as needed.
